<title>USA: Blue Circle begins Alabama plant expansion.</title>
<headline>Blue Circle begins Alabama plant expansion.</headline>
<dateline>MARIETTA, Ga. 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Blue Circle Cement, a subsidiary of Blue Circle Industries Plc, said on Friday it began work on $40 million of improvments and an expansion of its Calera, Alabama, lime plant.</p>
<p>The plant's capacity will increase 60 percent to 400,000 tons annually from the current 250,000 tons, Blue Circle said.</p>
